bell_bowl_small.wav, bell_bowl_medium.wav, bell_bowl_deep.wav, bell_temple.wav,
bell_handbell.wav, bell_chime.wav, bell_tingsha.wav, bell_wood_block.wav,
bell_wooden_fish.wav, bell_gong.wav
Original modal synthesis for Meditejo, 2026: singing bowls, a temple bell, a
hand bell, a chime, tingsha, a wood block, a wooden fish and a gong, each a sum
of decaying sines with a short synthesised strike. No recorded samples.
Generated by tools/meditejo/generate_bells.py (fixed parameters and seed;
tools/meditejo/generate_bells.py --check regenerates them byte-for-byte).
To the extent copyright applies, the authors dedicate these ten generated
sounds to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal (CC0-1.0):
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

